<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Imdemnity Corp on Monday said it qualified six municipal bond issues, which will be sold competitively, for insurance.</p>
<p>--Kingman Municipal Property, Ariz., $4.45 million Excise Tax Revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Mesa, Ariz., $94.73 million Utility System Revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Mesa, Ariz., $24 million general obligations.</p>
<p>--Westland, Mich., $6 million water and sewer revs.</p>
<p>--Bartlesville, Okla., $3 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Kimberly, Wis., $2.55 million GOs. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
